  {
    "id": 2009006110050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへ\r\nここなら、いっぱい飛ばせます！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900611/2009006110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006110060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "今日持ってきたのはこれとこれとこれと……\r\nあとあと、このおっきいやつです！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900611/2009006110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ずいぶん色々持ってきたんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006110070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！　この細いのは小さいのがいっぱいできて、\r\nおっきいのはおっきなシャボン玉ができるんです！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900611/2009006110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006110080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "どれもスッゴく面白くって選べなかったから、\r\n全部持ってきちゃいました！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900611/2009006110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうことだったのか\r\n……それにしても、どうして急にシャボン玉を？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006110090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えっと……それは……\r\n……プロデューサーさんが……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900611/2009006110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺が……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006110100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんが、最近スッゴく忙しそうで……\r\n毎日、いっぱいがんばってて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900611/2009006110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006110110,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしも、何かお手伝いできないかな……って、\r\n色々考えたんです",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900611/2009006110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂……\r\nそんなことを考えててくれていたのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006110120,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でも、プロデューサーさんのお仕事は、\r\nあたしには難しくってお手伝いできません……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900611/2009006110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006110130,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でも、あたしにできることがしたいなって、\r\nずっとずーっと考えてました",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900611/2009006110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006110140,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "それで、前におうちでやった\r\nシャボン玉を思い出したんです",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900611/2009006110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006110150,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ふわふわと浮かんでるシャボン玉を見てたら\r\nなんだか自分もふわふわって、空に浮かんでるような……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900611/2009006110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006110160,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしもシャボン玉になったような、\r\n不思議な気持ちになったんです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900611/2009006110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "シャボン玉に……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006110170,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "だから、今だけ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900611/2009006110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006110180,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんも\r\nシャボン玉になってほしいんです！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900611/2009006110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そうか……\r\n果穂は俺に息抜きをしてほしくて……）",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう、果穂\r\nその気持ちは、しっかり伝わったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
